@*
    HR Policy (docs/03_PageBlueprints.md "Page — HR Policy"). Title/
    description/canonical/OG/AboutPage schema come from ViewData["Seo"] +
    ViewData["SeoPageType"], set in HrPolicyController.Index via
    ISeoService — see _Layout.cshtml's <head> and
    SeoStructuredDataViewComponent.

    Folkart-reference revision (2026-08-17, project owner-approved) — page
    flow: Breadcrumb (Anasayfa → İnsan Kaynakları Politikamız) → plain page
    heading (small eyebrow + "İK Politikaları" H1) + one intro paragraph →
    eight heading/bullet-list content sections (HrPolicySectionsViewComponent).
    Same "no Hero Banner, plain bold sans-serif H1 + full-width paragraph
    column" pattern as About/Values/Career/Contact's own Folkart-reference
    revisions. HeroBannerStandard and the HrPhilosophy/CorePrinciples/
    EmployeeDevelopment view components are intentionally not invoked here
    — neither component nor its assets were modified or deleted, they are
    simply unused by this page now, same "leave unused, don't delete"
    precedent as Career's WhyJoinAncin.

    2026-08-17 correction: the breadcrumb trail is now a single item
    ("İnsan Kaynakları Politikamız"), matching every other page's
    single-level trail — the earlier three-level "Önce İnsan" trail and its
    accompanying page-scoped separator-fix wrapper have been removed. The
    horizontal banner image that previously sat between the intro paragraph
    and the first content section has also been removed outright (project
    owner's explicit correction), not replaced.

    The reference's eyebrow text reads "Saya Holding" — Folkart's own
    parent holding company, a real, unrelated business. Reproducing that
    literal name here would misrepresent Ançın's own corporate identity, so
    it is replaced with "Ancın İnşaat" (project owner-confirmed 2026-08-17)
    while keeping the reference's small-text-above-heading structure.
*@

@{
    var breadcrumbTrail = new List<AncinInsaat.ViewComponents.BreadcrumbItem>
    {
        new() { Label = "İnsan Kaynakları Politikamız" }
    };
}
@await Component.InvokeAsync("Breadcrumb", new { trail = breadcrumbTrail, homeLabel = "Anasayfa" })

<section class="section hr-policy-heading-section">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="hr-policy-eyebrow">Ancın İnşaat</p>
        <h1 id="hr-policy-heading" class="hr-policy-heading">İK Politikaları</h1>
        <p class="hr-policy-intro">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat, duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur.</p>
    </div>
</section>

@await Component.InvokeAsync("HrPolicySections")
